{
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "leatherworker_new_greeting_tannery",
      "request": "greeting",
      "weight": 26,
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "line_0",
          "text": "Mind the tannery. The smell is honest, at least."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_1",
          "text": "Give the tannery room. Leatherwork works better without elbows in it."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_2",
          "text": "Step carefully near the tannery. I would rather greet you than patch you up."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_3",
          "text": "There you are. I was just near the cauldron, trying to keep the day sensible."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_4",
          "text": "Mind the dye. It has a longer memory than most people."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_5",
          "text": "Hello. If the smell bothers you, that means it is working."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_6",
          "text": "You caught me with a needle in hand and patience on trial."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_7",
          "text": "Step around the stretched hides. They are busy becoming useful."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_8",
          "text": "Good timing. I was just checking seams."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_9",
          "text": "Keep your sleeves clear unless you want them permanently improved."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_10",
          "text": "I can talk while the leather softens."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_11",
          "text": "Welcome. Do not sit on anything that looks unfinished."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_12",
          "text": "If you came about boots, show me the damage first."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_13",
          "text": "The tannery is calm today. That is suspicious but welcome."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_14",
          "text": "Hello there. Try not to disturb the straps I just arranged."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_15",
          "text": "I was measuring twice because mistakes here get expensive."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_16",
          "text": "Stand where the floor is dry and tell me what you need."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_17",
          "text": "Good to see you wearing things that still hold together."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_18",
          "text": "I have thread, tools, and a little time."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_19",
          "text": "Good timing. I was about to take a break from the tannery."
        },
